{"Title":"An Act amending chapter 305 of the acts of 2016 relative to the year-round market rate rental housing trust fund in the town of Provincetown","BillNumber":"S2744","DocketNumber":"SD3188","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2024-04-19T11:39:56.52"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2024-04-19T11:39:56.52"},{"Id":"SKP1","Name":"Sarah K. Peake","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SKP1","ResponseDate":"2024-04-19T11:39:56.5366667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2744/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Cyr, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2744) of Julian Cyr and Sarah K. Peake (by vote of the town) for legislation to amend chapter 305 of the acts of 2016 relative to the year-round market rate rental housing trust fund in the town of Provincetown.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 1 of Chapter 305 of the Acts of 2016 is hereby amended by inserting the following words after the word \"units\":- and year-round ownership opportunities. \r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 2(a) of said chapter 305 is hereby amended by inserting the following words after the word \"trustees\":- and two alternates. \r\n\tSECTION 3. Section 5 of said chapter 305 is hereby amended by inserting the following word after the word \"rental\":- or ownership. \r\n\tSECTION 4. Upon the effective date of this act, the year-round market rate rental housing trust fund shall be known as the Year-Round Market Rate Housing Trust Fund. \r\n\tSECTION 5. This act shall take effect upon passage. \r\n\tOr to take any other action relative thereto. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[{"Description":"S2744 -- Provincetown-rental housing trust fund.","DownloadUrl":"http://malegislature.gov/api/DownloadReport?attachmentId=18157&title=S2744%20--%20Provincetown-rental%20housing%20trust%20fund."}],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"S2744","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2744/Branches/Senate/Amendments/1/"}]}